WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:07.250
I've been hooked on Instagram lately.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:11.166
I don't particularly stand out at work
or in my private life...

00:00:12.041 --> 00:00:13.625
but when I post cute pictures,

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:15.958
I get validation from lots of people.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.500
1 LIKE

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:21.375
People whose faces I don't even know

00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:24.208
are cheering me on
with their "likes" from afar.

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:27.166
LIKES

00:00:35.916 --> 00:00:36.916
It's nothing special.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.750
This is 1,800 yen?

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:44.833
You got 54 "likes," huh?

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:47.375
Well, it's an improvement.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.666
Thank you, coach!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.125
I owe it all to your helpful pointers!

00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:53.375
-You're not quite there yet.
-What?

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:56.500
You're not putting any thought
into your shots.

00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:58.208
Take this pic, for example.

00:00:58.583 --> 00:01:01.000
Some old guy's head
is totally in the frame.

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:02.083
Argh!

00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:03.333
In this case...

00:01:04.166 --> 00:01:06.666
first, you should change the angle
to cut him out.

00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:09.333
Use the light from the window
as a half-backlight.

00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:12.166
Make the subject pop
by blurring the background,

00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:14.041
and add a little finishing touch.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.000
Wow! It looks even more mouth-watering!

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:19.208
With that, your "likes" will double.

00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.541
Coach, you're amazing!

00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.875
Now, let's work on your selfies.

00:01:24.291 --> 00:01:27.416
What the heck is this?
It's absolutely terrible!

00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:29.000
-I forgot...
-Huh?

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.083
All this talk of Christmas

00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:33.583
has reminded me that I found
a new restaurant online yesterday!

00:01:33.666 --> 00:01:36.583
Their Christmas menu
is available for a limited time only.

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.583
It's so cute
and I was planning to go today.

00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:40.666
Oh, I see.

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:42.833
Where is this place?

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:44.500
In Kamakura.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.125
Kamakura?

00:01:47.208 --> 00:01:48.708
Well, I'm off now!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.708
You're going there now?

00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.333
It begins as a hobby, but soon,
posting pics becomes an obligation.

00:01:55.416 --> 00:01:57.000
Before you know it,

00:01:57.333 --> 00:02:01.125
she'll be going out of her way
to a café in a different prefecture,

00:02:01.208 --> 00:02:02.666
just to post a single pic.

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:05.750
It's begun.

00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.208
She's stuck in the bottomless pit
that is Instagram!

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.208
We're gonna get a complaint
from Instagram.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.083
3 LIKES

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.541
Retsuko, do you have
any plans for Christmas Eve?

00:02:27.125 --> 00:02:27.958
What?

00:02:28.666 --> 00:02:29.500
No...

00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.875
I haven't made any plans yet.

00:02:32.833 --> 00:02:36.958
How can you be so calm?
Christmas Eve is less than a week away!

00:02:37.041 --> 00:02:38.083
Yeah...

00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:41.416
A special date!
A party with your closest friends!

00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:45.791
No other event is more important
for Instagram girls than Christmas Eve.

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:48.583
Can't I just spend time at home
with my family?

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:49.541
No.

00:02:49.958 --> 00:02:53.416
Don't you get it? Your private life
is no longer yours alone.

00:02:53.541 --> 00:02:55.000
It belongs to everyone!

00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.500
Who would be interested
in a boring, conventional Christmas?

00:02:58.583 --> 00:02:59.833
Who would give that "likes"?

00:03:00.208 --> 00:03:03.291
Bigger! Grander! Pull out all the stops.

00:03:03.375 --> 00:03:08.333
Broadcast your glamorous lifestyle
to the world and share your happiness!

00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:11.333
That's our duty as Instagram girls.

00:03:12.916 --> 00:03:14.083
Well, good luck!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:16.583
I'll...

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:18.083
I'll do my best.

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:47.833
5,359 LIKES
DINNER WITH BAE TONIGHT

00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:49.333
Why is it just me?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:51.958
Why is it just me?

00:03:52.541 --> 00:03:56.791
Merry Christmas!

00:03:56.875 --> 00:03:59.000
I can still do it! Battling alone!

00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:01.458
If I give in now, it's seriously over

00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:03.166
Social media! Social media!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.791
It's where I document my Christmas Eve

00:04:05.875 --> 00:04:09.666
Only the number of "likes" I receive
Makes me feel alive

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.875
Only the number of "likes" I receive
Makes me feel alive

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:25.000
RETSU

